+| W | 0.1%: 1.00 / 1.10 / 1.15 | **1%**: 1.00 / 1.10 / 1.15 | 10%: 1.00 / 1.10 / 1.15 | velocity 1% / 10% (2,000 keys) |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 s | 1.000 / 0.838 / 0.973 | 0.283 / 0.285 / 0.269 | 0.084 / 0.079 / 0.091 | 0.322 / 0.082 |
+| 5 s | 0.387 / 0.442 / 0.421 | **0.139 / 0.111 / 0.109** | 0.039 / 0.034 / 0.041 | 0.373 / 0.089 |
+| 15 s | 0.205 / 0.277 / 0.224 | **0.063 / 0.058 / 0.063** | 0.021 / 0.015 / 0.019 | 0.359 / 0.079 |
