+Cost (`lab/cg.sh . ActiveKeys/full 20 60` and `ActiveKeys/1pct 2000 6000`; benchFilter, Capacity 1M = 294,118 lines, 1.18 M slots): **full scan 33.55 M library Ir per call** (28.5 Ir per slot; 308 k D1 misses, one per line) and **1% sample 335,649 Ir** (exactly 1/100). The loop divides `j · lines / k` on every line; a contiguous loop for the full scan would cost less, not measured.
