+**Readings.** Counters: `git apply --directory=go go/verify/experiments/next-n7-work.patch` (library hooks are `workAdd` calls compiled away without `-tags tfwork`; gates with the patch and no tag identical: sanity 51 s, digest 64 s, exact 17 s). `TF_EXP=1 TF_TRACE=$LAB/h2h/heavy16x.trace go test -tags tfwork -count=1 -run '^TestWork$' -v .` (16 s; `lab/readings/n7-main.txt`). The hot-entry counter was checked by hand (200 touches of one key in two units: 339 hot-entry accesses); no workload below reaches a hot entry. Deterministic: main's sweep workload run twice gave identical lines.
