+| HEAD | 1.15 (97.8%) | 96.604 / 854 | 4.000 | | | 4,577 | — | 20.59 (stash) |
+| added 5% | 1.00 | **4.829 / 8** | 2.675 | 6.68 | 2.49e-8 | 60,762 | 72,551 | 19.80 |
