+| set | uniform → corrected: 1 s | 5 s | 15 s | 30 s | 60 s | mean |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| MAWI second half (held out) | 0.2288 → 0.2272 | 0.0221 → 0.0250 | 0.0506 → 0.0520 | 0.0339 → 0.0357 | 0.0108 → 0.0146 | 0.0693 → **0.0709** |
